WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:03,190
little sister

2
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:04,530
You see the environment here is so good

3
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:06,730
And it's really safe otherwise

4
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:09,450
You can stay in a single room tonight and have a good rest.

5
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:11,010
Then please ask the boss to open two rooms.

6
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:12,370
A single room for my sister

7
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:13,850
A double room for us as a couple

8
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:15,620
Recharge successful

9
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,100
Please keep your room card

10
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,740
The rooms are all on the second floor.

11
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:21,380
You can buy food from the lunch machine in the lobby, and you can buy food from the water dispenser next to it.

12
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,580
There is also pure water to drink

13
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:23,900
Ordinary people like us

14
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:26,540
Can you also eat such good food? Hello

15
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,780
Please, can you teach me how to buy it?

16
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:31,530
Is it because I'm not pretty enough?

17
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:34,290
If only I could be like the boss

18
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:35,370
Just take good care of it and it'll be fine

19
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:37,010
Little sister, you live in 102 on the first floor

20
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:38,330
You go back to your room and eat your meal first

21
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:39,850
After dinner, come to me upstairs in 202

22
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:40,890
The boss just said

23
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:42,530
You can actually take a shower in the room

24
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:48,930
Okay, sister is amazing

25
00:00:49,330 --> 00:00:50,770
This is simply heaven

26
00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:53,290
The absolute value of this golden crane flower
